In this code, the [`cellSize`](command:_github.copilot.openSymbolFromReferences?%5B%22%22%2C%5B%7B%22uri%22%3A%7B%22scheme%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22authority%22%3A%22%22%2C%22path%22%3A%22%2FUsers%2Fmichaelpaulukonis%2Fprojects%2Fmy-sketches%2Feditor_sketches%2FSTRENGTHENED_HONEY_MOSAIC%2Fsketch.js%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fragment%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22pos%22%3A%7B%22line%22%3A23%2C%22character%22%3A6%7D%7D%5D%2C%222d549312-2cdf-4db3-8fa4-30882696ebfd%22%5D "Go to definition") is dynamically adjustable using a slider. When the slider value changes, the [`processEverything`](command:_github.copilot.openSymbolFromReferences?%5B%22%22%2C%5B%7B%22uri%22%3A%7B%22scheme%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22authority%22%3A%22%22%2C%22path%22%3A%22%2FUsers%2Fmichaelpaulukonis%2Fprojects%2Fmy-sketches%2Feditor_sketches%2FSTRENGTHENED_HONEY_MOSAIC%2Fsketch.js%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fragment%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22pos%22%3A%7B%22line%22%3A239%2C%22character%22%3A6%7D%7D%5D%2C%222d549312-2cdf-4db3-8fa4-30882696ebfd%22%5D "Go to definition") function is called to reprocess the images and rebuild the mosaic with the new [`cellSize`](command:_github.copilot.openSymbolFromReferences?%5B%22%22%2C%5B%7B%22uri%22%3A%7B%22scheme%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22authority%22%3A%22%22%2C%22path%22%3A%22%2FUsers%2Fmichaelpaulukonis%2Fprojects%2Fmy-sketches%2Feditor_sketches%2FSTRENGTHENED_HONEY_MOSAIC%2Fsketch.js%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fragment%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22pos%22%3A%7B%22line%22%3A23%2C%22character%22%3A6%7D%7D%5D%2C%222d549312-2cdf-4db3-8fa4-30882696ebfd%22%5D "Go to definition"). This allows you to achieve a more detailed output without needing a higher-resolution image.

Yes, it is possible to avoid reprocessing the [`tileLayer`](command:_github.copilot.openSymbolFromReferences?%5B%22%22%2C%5B%7B%22uri%22%3A%7B%22scheme%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22authority%22%3A%22%22%2C%22path%22%3A%22%2FUsers%2Fmichaelpaulukonis%2Fprojects%2Fmy-sketches%2Feditor_sketches%2FSTRENGTHENED_HONEY_MOSAIC%2Fsketch.js%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fragment%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22pos%22%3A%7B%22line%22%3A19%2C%22character%22%3A6%7D%7D%5D%2C%22e0eaade5-db70-4a7f-be52-95f6038fcd7f%22%5D "Go to definition") and only reprocess the [`layoutLayer`](command:_github.copilot.openSymbolFromReferences?%5B%22%22%2C%5B%7B%22uri%22%3A%7B%22scheme%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22authority%22%3A%22%22%2C%22path%22%3A%22%2FUsers%2Fmichaelpaulukonis%2Fprojects%2Fmy-sketches%2Feditor_sketches%2FSTRENGTHENED_HONEY_MOSAIC%2Fsketch.js%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fragment%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22pos%22%3A%7B%22line%22%3A20%2C%22character%22%3A6%7D%7D%5D%2C%22e0eaade5-db70-4a7f-be52-95f6038fcd7f%22%5D "Go to definition") to save time. You can modify the [`processEverything`](command:_github.copilot.openSymbolFromReferences?%5B%22%22%2C%5B%7B%22uri%22%3A%7B%22scheme%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22authority%22%3A%22%22%2C%22path%22%3A%22%2FUsers%2Fmichaelpaulukonis%2Fprojects%2Fmy-sketches%2Feditor_sketches%2FSTRENGTHENED_HONEY_MOSAIC%2Fsketch.js%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fragment%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22pos%22%3A%7B%22line%22%3A239%2C%22character%22%3A6%7D%7D%5D%2C%22e0eaade5-db70-4a7f-be52-95f6038fcd7f%22%5D "Go to definition") function to only reprocess the [`layoutLayer`](command:_github.copilot.openSymbolFromReferences?%5B%22%22%2C%5B%7B%22uri%22%3A%7B%22scheme%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22authority%22%3A%22%22%2C%22path%22%3A%22%2FUsers%2Fmichaelpaulukonis%2Fprojects%2Fmy-sketches%2Feditor_sketches%2FSTRENGTHENED_HONEY_MOSAIC%2Fsketch.js%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fragment%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22pos%22%3A%7B%22line%22%3A20%2C%22character%22%3A6%7D%7D%5D%2C%22e0eaade5-db70-4a7f-be52-95f6038fcd7f%22%5D "Go to def