b70-4a7f-be52-95f6038fcd7f%22%5D "Go to definition"), thus avoiding the reprocessing of the [`tileLayer`](command:_github.copilot.openSymbolFromReferences?%5B%22%22%2C%5B%7B%22uri%22%3A%7B%22scheme%22%3A%22file%22%2C%22authority%22%3A%22%22%2C%22path%22%3A%22%2FUsers%2Fmichaelpaulukonis%2Fprojects%2Fmy-sketches%2Feditor_sketches%2FSTRENGTHENED_HONEY_MOSAIC%2Fsketch.js%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22%22%2C%22fragment%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22pos%22%3A%7B%22line%22%3A19%2C%22character%22%3A6%7D%7D%5D%2C%22e0eaade5-db70-4a7f-be52-95f6038fcd7f%22%5D "Go to definition").
